      "name": "Keto Breakfast Sandwich Recipe [with Low-Carb Chaffles]",
      "description": "These breakfast chaffle sandwiches are a hearty breakfast option! They're very easy to whip up and top with a few nutritious ingredients to come up with a tasty and filling breakfast!\n\nThey are quite calorie-dense so you can use it as a fast-breaking meal or adjust the fillings to fit your macros a bit better. If you need lower calories, consider using less (or no) avocado and using something lighter like sour cream instead.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\nChaffle:\n1 large egg\n1/2 cup cheddar cheese, shredded\n\nSandwich:\n2 teaspoon mayonnaise\n2 ounce bacon\n1 large egg\n1/4 medium avocado\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 1 servings of Keto Breakfast Chaffle Sandwich. Each serving comes out to be 844 calories, 71.1g fat, 3.6g net carbs, and 43.9g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
